{"_v":3,"id":"the-umbrellas-of-cherbourg-west-end-2011","cat":"west-end","bd":{"positive":1,"mixed":0,"negative":3},"rv":[{"cn":"Michael Billington","o":"The Guardian","s":54,"b":"Negative","t":1,"v":"mixed","u":"https://www.theguardian.com/stage/2011/mar/23/the-umbrellas-of-cherbourg-review","d":"2011-03-23","q":"Watching the stage version is like seeing a Technicolor film rendered in black and white..."},{"cn":null,"o":"The Independent","s":43,"b":"Negative","t":1,"v":"negative","u":"https://www.independent.co.uk/arts-entertainment/theatre-dance/reviews/the-umbrellas-of-cherbourg-gielgud-theatre-london-2251147.html","d":"2011-03-24","q":"Here, though, they impose similar techniques on a fragile story that can't survive them."},{"cn":"Henry Hitchings","o":"Evening Standard","s":41,"b":"Negative","t":1,"v":"negative","u":"http://www.thisislondon.co.uk/theatre/review-23934627-theres-not-much-to-stir-the-emotions-in-the-umbrellas-of-cherbourg.do","d":"2011-03-23","q":"It's all rather insipid and bitty - the film's colour is lost, and little is added."},{"cn":"Michael Coveney","o":"WhatsOnStage","s":78,"b":"Positive","t":2,"v":"positive","u":"https://www.whatsonstage.com/news/the-umbrellas-of-cherbourg_9543/","d":"2011-03-23","q":"The approach here is quieter, more low-tech and – if they can do something about that first “mauvais quart d’heure” – just as seductive."}],"pd":"2011-03-22"}